### Page 56 of 66

```text
SECTION 9.8 INTEREST
Whenever this Lease refers to “lnterest, the rate shall he ten percent (10%).
SECTION 9.9 LATE PAYMENTS
Should Tenant fail to pay when due any installment of Annual Rent or any other
sum payable to Landlord under the terms of this Lease, then Jnterest shall accrue from the
date of such delinquency and shall continue until such Sum is paid. and such Interest
together with a Late Charge of One Hundred Dollars ($100.00) t shall be paid by Tenant
to Landlord at the time of payment of the delinquent sum.
SECTION 9.10 CONSENTS
With respect to any provision of this Lease which either provides or is held to
provide that consent is required, Landlord or Tenant shall not unreasonably withhold or
unreasonably delay any consent or approval.
SECTION 9.11 NOTICES
Whenever notice shall or may be given to either of the parties by the other, each
such notice shall be by registered or certified mail with return receipt requested to the
respective address of the party to receive notice as contained herein or to such other address
as either party may from time to time designate in writing to the other. Any notice under
this Lease shall be deemed to have been given at the time it is placed in the mail with
sufficient postage prepaid.
SECTION 9.12 NO BROKER
Tenant warrants and represents that no broker was involved on its behalf in
negotiating or consummating this Lease and agrees to indemnify and hold Landlord
harmless from and against any and all claims for brokerage commissions arising out of any
communications or negotiations had by Tenant with any broker regarding the Leased
Premises or any other premises in the building and/or the consummation of this Lease.
Landlord is solely responsible for the payment of any brokers commission.
SECTION 9.13 SHORT FORM LEASE
Tenant agrees not to record this Lease without the express written consent of
Landlord and further agrees to execute, acknowledge and deliver at any time after the date
of this Lease, at the request of Landlord, a “short form lease” suitable for recording.
SECTION 9.14 ENTIRE AND BINDING AGREEMENT
This Business Lease Agreement contains all of the agreements between the parties
hereto and it may not be modified in any manner other than by agreement in writing signed
